    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nKilbride Lodge is a boutique development of just 28 spacious 1, 2 & 3 bedroom apartments tucked away in the heart of Castleknock.\n\nThis rare and unique opportunity to acquire a brand-new apartment in the centre of Castleknock Village is perfectly suited to young professionals, right sizers and investors alike. \n\nThese exceptionally roomy and bright apartments are built to the highest of standards with a Building Energy Rating (BER) of A3.\n\nThere is an excellent choice of local amenities such as Castleknock & Luttrellstown Golf Clubs, Castleknock Lawn Tennis Club and is only a 15-minute walk from Phoenix Park, Europe's largest enclosed public park.\n\nFor those looking for easy access to major routeways, Kilbride Lodge is ideal. The M50 & N3 is only 23-minute drive and Castleknock Village is also serviced by an excellent and frequent bus service making Kilbride Lodge a desirable location.\n\nBER: A3"
      }
    ],
